msgid "The app writes each kind of data into its own tab, laid out like the app's form: row 2 holds the field names (hover for help), grey columns are read-only, a changed cell turns amber and an emptied one red, and a required field left empty turns red. Choose from the lists, tick the boxes, double-click a date for a calendar. Add a row for a new person or record (a new record needs the person's PersonID). Check writes each row's finding into the Status column; nothing reaches the app until you carry it out. On the Assignments tab an empty post ends the assignment, and changes become draft orders."
